<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/21/msa@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta Lembaga Pemasaran Pertanian Persekutuan 1965 [Akta 141], yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 3 dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(2a) Notwithstanding paragraph (2)(a), the licence for importers and exporters of agricultural produce shall be issued by the Director General of Quarantine and Inspection and in accordance with the Malaysian Quarantine and Inspection Services Act 2011 [Act ]. (2 b) Notwithstanding paragraph (2)(c), the issuance of certificates for the purpose of importation shall be issued by the Director General of Quarantine and Inspection and in accordance with the Malaysian Quarantine and Inspection Services Act 2011.”. Seksyen baru 17a"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/21/msa@> .
