<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/21/msa@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (1), “entry point”, “quarantine station” and “quarantine premises” have the same meanings as assigned to these expressions in the Malaysian Quarantine and Inspection Services Act 2011.”. Kecualian"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/21/msa@> .
